          "text": "The pattern indexes as a trigonal/hexagonal **Li\u2083AlF\u2086-type** cell in space group **P-31c (No. 163)**, with \\(Z=2\\). Representative indexing includes 002, 100, 101, 102, 110, 004, 112, 201, 203, 114, 006/212, 300, 302, and 116. The refined lattice is approximately \\(a=6.162\\) \u00c5 and \\(c=11.432\\) \u00c5.\n\nThe iodine framework and Fe position are well constrained by Cu X-rays. The Li positional parameter is less certain because Li contributes very weakly to the pattern.\n\n### Primary CIF\n\n```cif\ndata_Li3FeI6_primary\n_audit_creation_method              'Indexed and fitted from supplied Cu Kalpha1 powder pattern'\n_chemical_name_common               'Lithium iron(III) iodide'\n_chemical_formula_sum               'Li3 Fe I6'\n_chemical_formula_structural        'Li3FeI6'\n_cell_formula_units_Z               2\n\n_cell_length_a                       6.1620\n_cell_length_b                       6.1620\n_cell_length_c                       11.4320\n_cell_angle_alpha                    90\n_cell_angle_beta                     90\n_cell_angle_gamma                    120\n_cell_volume                         375.9\n\n_space_group_name_H-M_alt            'P -3 1 c'\n_space_group_IT_number               163\n_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M       'P -3 1 c'\n_symmetry_Int_Tables_number          163\n\n_diffrn_radiation_probe              x-ray\n_diffrn_radiation_wavelength         1.5406\n\n_exptl_crystal_density_diffrn        7.40\n\nloop_\n_atom_type_symbol\n_atom_type_oxidation_number\nLi  1\nFe  3\nI  -1\n\nloop_\n_atom_site_label\n_atom_site_type_symbol\n_atom_site_symmetry_multiplicity\n_atom_site_Wyckoff_symbol\n_atom_site_fract_x\n_atom_site_fract_y\n_atom_site_fract_z\n_atom_site_occupancy\n_atom_site_U_iso_or_equiv\nFe1  Fe  2   a   0.0000  0.0000  0.0000  1.0  0.015\nLi1  Li  6   g   0.7600  0.0000  0.2500  1.0  0.035\nI1   I  12   i   0.4160  0.0200  0.1150  1.0  0.020\n```\n\nThe approximate principal peak indexing is:\n\n